# The hall model (hall-hi.glb, hall-lo.glb) is a rebuilt model of the lecture hall: plain shapes and flat
# colours, no photographs. It is in git with permission, with its default alignment (room.json) and the list of
# desks (hall-desks.json). Raw room scans are pictures of a real room and stay out of git.
*.glb
!hall-hi.glb
!hall-lo.glb
